          "kind": "informational",
          "level": "none",
          "guid": "mswk9431gbecq6ku",
          "message": {
            "text": "The hinted subset path must be opt-in because preserving bytecode across glyph compaction is not generally safe. A mapped glyph can remain present in cmap/glyf yet execute retained instructions against subset state that no longer matches the source, yielding no ink at selected ppem sizes; the outline-built path avoids that invalid program while preserving vector output. Focused browser evidence: 34-mathml-layout 10→0 regions, 34-mathml-basic 13→4, 03-lists-style-types 18→2, and 03-lists-ul-ol 21→12.",
            "markdown": "The hinted subset path must be opt-in because preserving bytecode across glyph compaction is not generally safe. A mapped glyph can remain present in cmap/glyf yet execute retained instructions against subset state that no longer matches the source, yielding no ink at selected ppem sizes; the outline-built path avoids that invalid program while preserving vector output. Focused browser evidence: 34-mathml-layout 10→0 regions, 34-mathml-basic 13→4, 03-lists-style-types 18→2, and 03-lists-ul-ol 21→12."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/render/embedded-font-builder.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 43,
                  "endLine": 49,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "/** The hinting-preserving hb-subset path is experimental and opt-in. Retained\n *  bytecode can refer to glyph/CVT state that no longer survives subsetting;\n *  when that happens Chromium may map a glyph successfully yet paint no ink at\n *  particular ppem sizes. The outline-built path is the safe default. */\nfunction hintedSubsetEnabled(): boolean {\n  return process.env.DOMOTION_HINTED_SUBSET === \"1\";\n}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "tags": [
              "rationale"
            ],
            "ext-ai-tool-confidence": 0.98
