          "guid": "mszj6uqru8c9oz7z",
          "message": {
            "text": "DM-2304 macOS 26 proof: the normal hinted path reproduced Telugu at 0.0420% and Kannada at 0.0356%, with U+0C04/U+0C5D and U+0C84/U+0CDD displaced after the SVG was rendered even though the SVG y coordinates were correct. The identical two-fixture run with DOMOTIONHINTEDSUBSET=0 was byte-clean for both, and the normal path became byte-clean after selecting the resolved-outline rebuild for CFF2. This isolates the defect to retained CFF2 consumption rather than shaping, routing, or a codepoint rule.",
            "markdown": "DM-2304 macOS 26 proof: the normal hinted path reproduced Telugu at 0.0420% and Kannada at 0.0356%, with U+0C04/U+0C5D and U+0C84/U+0CDD displaced after the SVG was rendered even though the SVG y coordinates were correct. The identical two-fixture run with DOMOTION_HINTED_SUBSET=0 was byte-clean for both, and the normal path became byte-clean after selecting the resolved-outline rebuild for CFF2. This isolates the defect to retained CFF2 consumption rather than shaping, routing, or a codepoint rule."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/render/embedded-font-builder.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 554,
                  "endLine": 569,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "      // animation paid that per generation, per entry, and threw away 58 MB each\n      // round.\n      //\n      // Placed BEFORE the read rather than around it on purpose: a `false`\n      // verdict must skip the read entirely, and that is the case worth fixing.\n      // A `true` verdict still needs the bytes for `hbSubsetRetainGids`, so the\n      // memo saves nothing there and is not meant to.\n      if (hintedOutlineGuard(entry.hintedSource.path, srcFaceIndex) === false) {\n        throw new Error(\"source has no subsettable outlines (memoized)\");\n      }\n      const bytes = readFileSync(entry.hintedSource.path);\n      if (rememberHintedOutlineGuard(entry.hintedSource.path, srcFaceIndex,\n                                     sfntHasSubsettableOutlines(bytes, srcFaceIndex))) {\n        // A retained CFF2 program is still variable when the emitted font is\n        // consumed as a fresh CSS face. That is not the same object Chromium\n        // painted through the platform typeface, even at a nominally-default"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
